{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A MINIMALIST COLORFUL LANDSCAPE BUILDER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655260/extras/ae4b6d23ee53f0663898a189d976ac0d.poster.avif?t=1769435553\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655260/extras/ae4b6d23ee53f0663898a189d976ac0d.webm?t=1769435553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655260/extras/ae4b6d23ee53f0663898a189d976ac0d.mp4?t=1769435553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf33 Paint the terrain and place natural elements to <strong>grow a beautiful landscape tile by tile</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udeb8 Discover <strong>many biomes</strong> organized in <strong>three main climates</strong>: temperate, polar and tropical</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Never compose the same landscape twice with <strong>procedurally generated archipelagos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcaf Leverage <strong>various placement rules</strong> to maximize your <strong>score</strong> and your <strong>strategy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Appreciate <strong>colorful 3D pixel art visuals</strong> with <strong>dynamic lighting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f Enjoy a <strong>relaxing</strong> and <strong>peaceful experience</strong> that you can come back to once in a while</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 Unleash <strong>your creativity</strong> and watch <strong>your tiny landscape</strong> slowly getting back to life</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st